       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COHESION-PROG.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-USER-NAME PIC X(30).
       01 WS-USER-AGE PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-ORDER-ID PIC 9(5).
       01 WS-ORDER-TOTAL PIC 9(7).
       01 WS-REPORT-DATE PIC X(10).
       01 WS-REPORT-TITLE PIC X(50).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       USER-SECTION SECTION.
       HANDLE-USER.
           MOVE "Alice" TO WS-USER-NAME.
           MOVE 30 TO WS-USER-AGE.
           DISPLAY WS-USER-NAME.
           DISPLAY WS-USER-AGE.
       ORDER-SECTION SECTION.
       HANDLE-ORDER.
           MOVE 12345 TO WS-ORDER-ID.
           MOVE 9999 TO WS-ORDER-TOTAL.
           DISPLAY WS-ORDER-ID.
           DISPLAY WS-ORDER-TOTAL.
       REPORT-SECTION SECTION.
       HANDLE-REPORT.
           MOVE "2024-01-01" TO WS-REPORT-DATE.
           MOVE "Monthly Sales" TO WS-REPORT-TITLE.
           DISPLAY WS-REPORT-DATE.
           DISPLAY WS-REPORT-TITLE.
